ble intracontinental settings, to be preserved over hundreds of millions of years. Specifically they looked at the interplay between partial melting, the formation of garnet-pyroxene-bearing rocks, and strain rate–dependent retrogression of those rocks; resulting in the preservation of thick and strong crustal roots.","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"oAWTkJ8KCi"}],"key":"x1H7kB1T20"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"At the heart of their work were a series of Underworld numerical models using metamorphic phase transitions (first-order); implemented with the ","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"pWwBynCP4j"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"PhaseChange()","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"FXlIlXIrgt"},{"type":"text","value":" functionality ","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"tZyf1C9b8D"},{"type":"link","url":"https://uwgeodynamics.readthedocs.io/en/latest/UserGuide.html#simple-phase-change","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"seen here","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"puOb952PfZ"}],"urlSource":"https://uwgeodynamics.readthedocs.io/en/latest/UserGuide.html#simple-phase-change","key":"sUXoeHhVbD"},{"type":"text","value":". The authors worked with the Underworld development team to apply ","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"oNBSjKk2wo"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"PhaseChage()","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"hsHKVdIWSf"},{"type":"text","value":" in the context of 2D thermo-mechanical crustal extension models. Exploring a mix of fast and slow extension conditions whilst toggling the phase changes demonstrated the viability of the new preservation mechanism.","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"oDAST5goT6"}],"key":"dFgnOANNJQ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The published model input files are available at the Underworld-Community ","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"key":"TnZbomHu4e"},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/underworld-community/cenki-tok-et-al-crustal-roots-in-stable-continents","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"key":"PUV0gwzdC6"}],"urlSource":"https://github.com/underworld-community/cenki-tok-et-al-crustal-roots-in-stable-continents","error":true,"key":"gLW3UqjiN5"},{"type":"text","value":" and can be run directly on Binder, hit the button below.","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"key":"hpxV8SSl5V"}],"key":"f4SO9JVIrz"},{"type":"container","kind":"table","children":[{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"tableRow","children":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/underworldcode.org-preview/145e9f4d13/build/badge_logo-4e4a78abb12141ccdcf389e289b5aa4e.svg","alt":"Binder","width":"109px","align":"center","key":"g67xdzMVLT","urlSource":"figures/badge_logo.svg"}],"key":"Z7nQt8dyot"},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://mybinder.org/v2/gh/underworld-community/cenki-tok-et-al-crustal-roots-in-stable-continents/master","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"mybinder.org/v2","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"key":"P6XxKRMwwn"}],"urlSource":"https://mybinder.org/v2/gh/underworld-community/